  "body": "This pull request will bring MAJOR changes to the following:\r\n- The qpu_auth is gone, and so is the access_object structure along with it! Users will now have to `create_device` for both local and cloud machines (providing credentials during initialisation for cloud ones)\r\n- Simulator backends have updates to their names\r\n- Workflows, some functions in RQAOA, factory methods like `get_qaoa_backend` have been updated to reflect this change\r\n- The unit-tests and all notebooks have been updated to reflect these changes \r\n- A few bugs have also been fixed along the way",
